# CLAUDE.md prohibition 2 is absolute: nothing under data/ is committed, and
# no exception is added for it. The two lines above are the doc 3 s3.1
# minimum; this line is what the agent rule actually requires.
#
# Consequence to resolve deliberately: data/DATASETS.md is a doc 3 s5.2
# artifact that doc 3 s6 lists as safe to commit, and this rule keeps it out
# of the repo. Ignoring it keeps the working tree clean so the confirmatory
# dirty-tree refusal stays meaningful; the alternative, leaving it untracked
# and visible, makes every tree permanently dirty. Moving it out of data/ is
# the fix, and that is a call for the maintainer, not for the agent.
data/

*.jsonl
*.parquet
*.jsonl.gz
